config MT6631_WLAN
	tristate "MediaTek MT6631 (CONSYS_6771) WLAN support"
	depends on ARCH_MEDIATEK || COMPILE_TEST
	depends on CFG80211
	select WIRELESS_EXT
	select WEXT_PRIV
	select CRC32
	help
	  Say Y or M here to build the vendor WLAN driver for the MediaTek
	  MT6631 connectivity combo chip.  On MT6771 (Helio P60/P70) the WiFi
	  MAC lives inside the CONNSYS subsystem and is driven over the AHB
	  HIF, not SDIO.

	  The driver is the MediaTek "gen3" WLAN stack (STA + P2P) with the
	  CONNSYS/WMT glue adapted to mainline.  It needs the WLAN firmware
	  blob (WIFI_RAM_CODE_6759) in /lib/firmware.

	  If unsure, say N.
